<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-INJURED LEONARDO MAY MISS BRAZIL MATCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INJURED LEONARDO MAY MISS BRAZIL MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paris St Germain playmaker Leonardo may miss Brazil's international against Chile next Wednesday with a pulled muscle.</p>
<p>Leonardo, who was injured in PSG's 2-1 league loss at Auxerre on Wednesday, was to receive X-ray treatment on Friday to decide whether he may be fit to join his national squad.</p>
<p>&quot;I hope it is not too serious. It hurts anyway. It's really bad luck,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
</text>
